silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_08_joc_and_regression_sections_03_failure_mode_atlas_concrete_anchor_29_CategoryO11#categoryo11 silm:hasLongDescription "The CategoryO11 is the page-11 olog category = Free(G_11) modulo R_11; the readable governed category. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'CategoryO11', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
